# The category filter of the .spun GUI (scratchpad/docs/design_category-filter.md),
# through gui-test.py's proxy (@PORT@) to the test server. mame-category.sh fills
# in @SPUN@ and @PORT@. gui-test.py expands "@ROWS T COMMAND" (also
# "SPCAT SLUG PAGE [TEXT]"), "@CATS T SEL" (the category picker), "@PICK T SLUG"
# (the keys that pick SLUG) and "@TEXT T ROW COL ATTR TEXT" into checks against
# the server's own replies. The commands the GUI sends are in the proxy's log,
# which mame-category.sh compares with the list at its end.
# Games holds gui003, gui005, gui011 and gui024 (src/web/e2e/gui-catalogue.mts);
# gui003 and gui011 have "zebra" in the description.
# A button that would do nothing is dim (attribute 0x0C): @BUTTONS names the live ones.
# In the picker the Category button is Back.
# BREAK is CAPS SHIFT + SPACE. The search field shows "Search:" at row 27.
put @SPUN@ /dot/SPUN
autostart .spun -p @PORT@
autostart PAUSE 0
autostart .ls /dot/SPUN
autostart PRINT "SPUNGUIDONE"
autostart FOR i=0 TO 1 STEP 0: NEXT i
seconds 102
noreset 7.5
mouse 2 move 128 128

# The catalogue, with the Category button after Search
@ROWS 15.5 SPLIST 1
@BUTTONS 15.5 nschq

# Key C: the picker, All selected. Down and up move the bar.
key 16.5 c
@CATS 19.5 0
@BUTTONS 19.5 b picker
snap 19.5
key 20.5 {DOWN}
@CATS 22.5 1
key 23 {DOWN}
@CATS 25 2
key 25.5 {UP}
@CATS 27.5 1

# Edit leaves the picker with the catalogue as it was
key 28 {EDIT}
@ROWS 31.5 SPLIST 1
@BUTTONS 31.5 nschq

# BREAK does the same
key 32 c
@CATS 35 0
key 35.5 {BREAK}
@ROWS 39 SPLIST 1

# Pick Games: its apps, the category in the status line
key 39.5 c
@CATS 42.5 0
@PICK 43 games
@ROWS 49 SPCAT games 1
@BUTTONS 49 schq
snap 49

# A search inside Games
key 49.5 s
key 50.5 zebra
key 52 {ENTER}
@ROWS 55.5 SPCAT games 1 zebra
snap 55.5

# BREAK cancels the search field: it was open, it closes, nothing is typed or
# sent, and the list and the search text are as they were
key 56 s
@TEXT 57 27 1 0 Search:
key 57.5 abc
key 58.5 {BREAK}
@TEXT 59.5 27 1 0         
@ROWS 59.5 SPCAT games 1 zebra

# All takes the category off and keeps the search text
key 60 c
@CATS 63 0
key 63.5 {ENTER}
@ROWS 67 SPFIND 1 zebra
@BUTTONS 67 schq
snap 67

# No search text, no category: the whole catalogue
key 67.5 s
key 68.5 {ENTER}
@ROWS 71.5 SPLIST 1

# In the picker key C does nothing; Back (key B) leaves it as Edit and BREAK do
key 72 c
@CATS 75 0
@BUTTONS 75 b picker
key 75.5 c
@CATS 78 0
key 78.5 b
@ROWS 82 SPLIST 1
@BUTTONS 82 nschq

# Help dims Prev and Next
key 83 h
@BUTTONS 84.5 schq
key 85 h
@BUTTONS 86.5 nschq

key 87 q
key 91 {SPACE}
screen 97 SPUNGUIDONE

snap 97
